  "o034": "To: Navandee employees\nFrom: Maxine Coleman, Chief sustainability officer\nSubject: Corporate responsibility\nDate: July 14\n\n\nAt Navandee, we have always endeavored to show our customers that we are an environmentally responsible company. Up until now, our primary focus has been to minimize the ecological effects of ---4----.\n\n\nThanks to your hard work and commitment, we have been doing an excellent job in this area. However, with the rapid changes taking place in the industry, we need to look beyond our present activities and find ---5---- ways to meet our goals.\n\n\nThis is why we are currently making plans to ---6---- new ways to maintain the environment’s biodiversity. Please take another look at our objectives on the company Web site. We would appreciate any suggestions that you may have. ---7----.\n\n\nI am certain that your submissions will reflect Navandee’s core values where ecological protection is concerned.\n\n\nThank you for your time.\n\n\nSincerely,\nMaxine Coleman",
