  "o039": "Fashion Insider Magazine\n\n\nSUBSCRIPTION:\nName: Lindsey Zuckerman\nAddress: 98 Stubberville Road, Salt Lake City, UT 84101\nPhone: 801-555-3065\nE-mail: lzuckerman@fastmail.com\n\n\nPlease check the appropriate box:\nWhich subscription plan do you prefer?\n○ 6 months ($19.99) ○ 1 year ($35.99) ■ 2 years ($49.99 — special offer)\n\n\nHow did you learn about this magazine?\n○ On a Web site ○ In a store ○ In an advertisement ■ Other\nIf other, please explain:\nMy friend Betsy is very interested in fashion, and she recommended that I read this magazine.\n\n\nWhich payment method would you like to use?\n○ Check ○ Cash ■ Credit Card\nIf you are paying by cash or check, please enclose the correct amount in an envelope and mail it to us, along with this form. If you are paying by credit card, please include your credit card information below:\n8891-2291-9941-1102\nCompany: SafeCard\nName on card: Lindsey P. Zuckerman\n\n\nWould you like to receive weekly e-mails about fashion trends?\n■ Yes ○ No\n\n\nFashion Insider magazine is a monthly journal for those who have a passion for dress and design. We have been hailed by the Paris Daily as “the go-to publication for those in the know about the fashion world.”\n\n\nIf you wish to cancel your subscription for any reason, please call our toll-free number at 1-800-555-1891. We thank you for your interest.",
